---
name: youtube-transcribe
description: "Use when the user wants to know what an online video says (YouTube, Facebook, or any site yt-dlp supports), or wants one archived — pasting a video URL with no other instruction, asking 「這支影片在講什麼」、「幫我抓逐字稿」、「把這個影片存起來」、「總結一下這個影片」, or \"what does this video say\", \"get me the transcript\", \"summarise this video\". Archives the video, thumbnail, subtitles and metadata with media-fetch, stopping there when the user only wants to keep it; otherwise makes the transcript with media-transcribe and routes it to a summariser sized by the tier the script reports. Skip for videos already transcribed, and for audio files already on disk that need no download."
